-- a molecule with its configurations: the graph, and at each atom the cyclic arrangement of three of its
-- neighbours. This is the object the field's representations do not have — the bond graph plus the
-- stereochemistry as data of the same kind, rather than stereo descriptors bolted onto a string.
Stereo : Type 1
Stereo = (M : Mol) × (mol-atoms M → Cyc (mol-atoms M))
